{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCSelectionSection@lastSelectedRowIndexPath","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"title":"lastSelectedRowIndexPath","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"lastSelectedRowIndexPath"}],"symbolKind":"ivar","fragments":[{"text":"lastSelectedRowIndexPath","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Variable"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection\/lastSelectedRowIndexPath","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The index path of the most recently selected row."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionsection\/lastselectedrowindexpath"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"NSIndexPath","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSIndexPath"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lastSelectedRowIndexPath","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","title":"STV"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSelectionSection":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCSelectionSection","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection","type":"topic","title":"SCSelectionSection","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionsection","abstract":[{"text":"This class functions as an SCTableViewModel section that is able to provide selection functionality.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The cells in this section represent different items that the end-user can select from, and they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are generated from NSStrings in its items array. Once a cell is selected, a checkmark appears next","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to it, similar to Apple’s Settings application where a user selects a Ringtone for their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iPhone. The section can be configured to allow multiple selection and to allow no selection at all.","type":"text"}]},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSelectionSection/lastSelectedRowIndexPath":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"lastSelectedRowIndexPath","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection\/lastSelectedRowIndexPath","type":"topic","title":"lastSelectedRowIndexPath","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionsection\/lastselectedrowindexpath","abstract":[{"text":"The index path of the most recently selected row.","type":"text"}]}}}